# Soft-Ora real estate — Figma source of truth

This site is a **live Soft-Ora** (software house) demo for real-estate agency owners. They buy the product; their name, logo, and data replace the demo content later. **Never ship “Walied Homes” copy, logos, or domain language.** Use **Soft-Ora** everywhere the Figma file says Walied Homes.

## Official logo (replaces Walied Homes)

Use **only** this file for header, footer, favicon/app icon, and any Figma logo slot:

- Asset: `src/assets/softora-logo.png`
- Wordmark: lowercase **softora** (blue parallelogram, white type, sparkle + swirl)
- Tagline under the mark when the design has space for a tagline: **digital solutions, made simple**
- Do not recreate the logo in CSS/SVG, crop off the tagline unless the Figma slot is icon-only, or use the Walied Homes / Vite / React marks.

