## Required workflow (every UI / page / component)

1. Use the **Figma MCP** (`plugin-figma-figma`). If tools are unauthenticated, authenticate, then continue.
2. Load **figma-design-to-code** before `get_design_context`.
3. Resolve the target frame (`get_metadata` / screenshot), then `get_design_context` with `fileKey` + `nodeId`.
4. Adapt the reference to this repo (reuse existing components, tokens, routes). Do not paste generated code blindly.
5. Replace Walied Homes branding with Soft-Ora: name, `src/assets/softora-logo.png` in every logo slot, favicon/title, footer, meta. Keep layout identical.
6. Verify in the browser against the Figma frame (desktop and mobile if the file has both).

```text
❌ BAD: Build a listing card from memory / generic Tailwind.
✅ GOOD: Same Figma hierarchy; swap “Walied Homes” → “Soft-Ora” and the Figma logo → `src/assets/softora-logo.png`.
```

## Out of scope for “creative” changes

No new pages, sections, or visual language unless the user asks **and** you still start from the closest Figma frame.
